      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "✓ Mission hub is the single entry — map → mission → (play | practice)\n✓ Adventure skips context intro (details live on mission page)\n✓ All practice sessions are study-only — Done studying → mission directly\n✓ Legacy /prep route removed — practice only via mission hub\n✓ Mission complete → map only (resetTabToRoot), no auto-chain to next mission\n✓ Back uses tab stack (not browser history) — predictable pop to previous screen",
      "originalText": "✓ Mission hub is the single entry — map → mission → (play | practice)\n✓ Adventure skips context intro (details live on mission page)\n✓ All practice sessions are study-only — Done studying → mission directly\n✓ Legacy /prep route removed — practice only via mission hub\n✓ Mission complete → map only (resetTabToRoot), no auto-chain to next mission\n✓ Back uses tab stack (not browser history) — predictable pop to previous screen",
